Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.78,0:00:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.69,0:00:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, it's freezing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, how long are they\Ngonna go at it today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.08,0:00:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten anything\Nsince this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.41,0:00:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I eat when I get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:29.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, look, I told you, bigger is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.16,0:00:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna make it fight,\Nheavier is the best choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then go find it and call back later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.94,0:00:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.85,0:00:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need to go somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell of a time to take a bathroom break.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at this! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think he eats fish sausage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.99,0:00:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That thing was in the\Ntournament, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you got a little panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.42,0:01:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joe, fish pandas don't\Neat meat, they eat bamboo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.72,0:01:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this panda eats fish sausage.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No cameras on the emergency stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.02,0:01:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.66,0:01:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a risky plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could cause you trouble later on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just need to secure\Nthe area by the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! It's Kirara!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Away from Hakari!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.08,0:01:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Panda, and that spiky-haired kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.72,0:01:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If panda helped him sneak in here,\Nthat means he's with jujutsu high?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.50,0:01:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means Yui is with Jujutsu High too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then that means Kin is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, boss, I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.04,0:02:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon dog, totality!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pushy girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My demon dog was thrown back?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.60,0:02:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from what Panda said, it\Ncouldn't get close enough to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.72,0:02:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.63,0:02:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda and the other two are marked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monitor room.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.70,0:02:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiroro's planning on\Nheading back to Hakari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kirara!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not your enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just want to ask Hakari for a favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm disappointed in you, Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.74,0:02:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even get close to\Nyou while walking or running!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suguru and I can't get\Nclose to us, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.95,0:03:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more than just being\Nable to approach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't separate from Demon Dog, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:11.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of a curse technique is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen! Save it, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My passion has gone cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let's hold\Nyour heart, let it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.38,0:03:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get it right.\NLet's try and let it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try again. Let's see?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.54,0:03:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet capable of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.28,0:04:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Expo the picture. The truth is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.46,0:04:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, it's not fair to forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.36,0:04:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let this beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.30,0:04:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My wire's got a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No high tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yerolette. Nashi jah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oto na Shoko wa na me nai.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.92,0:04:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kara sa bakari de.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.30,0:04:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.36,0:04:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sambu uka te.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:18.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.04,0:04:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizou mami rete.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.38,0:04:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koko o tsula basute. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.44,0:04:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizou. Aizou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take out the.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.76,0:04:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Psycho joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.86,0:04:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Iizu dente.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.26,0:04:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Da ma shi da ma shi de ii no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.78,0:04:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Da i Show nante ki ni shi nai yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aizou, Aizou ni mo Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at a stalemate. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:04:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hirata!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not currently with Jujutsu High.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what Tokyo's\Nlike right now, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The barriers that sprung up in\Neach region are related as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was an unprecedented attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.04,0:05:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of jujutsu terrorism\Nwe need hikari's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're the ones who\Nexcluded us in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.74,0:05:20.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You reap what you sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you we're not with jujutsu high.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened between\Nyou and the higher ups?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fought with the conservatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, their idea of conservative?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:33.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and goes beyond just their\Npolicy toward the regulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have set ideas of what\Nand what not jujutsu should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kugisaki's technique is a good example.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the kind of classic\Njujutsu the conservatives prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not stuff like the cursed videos\Nthat were popular a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.88,0:05:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As time goes on, even jujutsu\Nincorporates more new technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But some of those new techniques are\Nbound to make the conservatives fussing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kim's technique is a\Nperfect example of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why those stupid higher-ups lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.60,0:06:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.94,0:06:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have Satoru Gojo save\Nyour asses for you like always?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you have him, why do\Nyou need us so badly, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.00,0:06:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer is you're\Nlying about needing us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:13.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means you're here\Nfor some other reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.70,0:06:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.68,0:06:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Satoru Gojo has been sealed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.06,0:06:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the reason we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.72,0:06:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, they don't believe us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well I can understand that but this\Nperson is the one closest to Hakari.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rabbit escape bunny rabbits?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:51.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can just convince them negotiations\Nwith the Car will go more smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Crux.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, Acrux!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lot of bunnies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.70,0:07:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.28,0:07:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My technique marks cursed energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it treats sorcerers and their\Nshikigamis the exact same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the bunnies will be\Ndrawn to him like that dog he was,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.00,0:07:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he'll be crushed under his\Nown shikigami until he suffocates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.66,0:07:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.88,0:07:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me about Rabbit Escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.50,0:07:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were almost as cute as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mean how they looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were they able to\Napproach and not approach?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.50,0:07:39.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.41,0:07:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were able to get up to that\Nsecond floor with no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they couldn't get\Nnear Kirara or the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.68,0:07:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda, do you have anything\Nwritten on your body?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.06,0:07:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A star and a name somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.86,0:07:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Imai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have one too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.96,0:07:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imai! There!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:07:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:00.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like on the rabbits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably on totality too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything\Nabout their technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.48,0:08:07.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:12.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This technique is based\Non a constellation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.72,0:08:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone looking at the sky\Ncould figure that part out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the constellation is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.82,0:08:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Southern Cross!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.36,0:08:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He both let it show on our faces!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He gave me a look like, seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just guessed my technique\Nwas based on the Southern Cross,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he wasn't sure about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.92,0:08:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I gave him that same stupid look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I confirmed it for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he figures out any more of my technique,\Nhe'll be able to enter the monitor room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.20,0:08:51.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to stop him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:53.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back in a stalemate again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.16,0:08:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But was it really the Southern Cross?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsumiki taught me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.76,0:09:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really know about the other ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.86,0:09:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But isn't the Southern Cross\Na four-star constellation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.94,0:09:08.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I can still get close to Panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda, do you happen to know if the\NSouthern Cross has four stars in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I mean it's a cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.20,0:09:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So there has to be at least four.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.36,0:09:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirara's technique must apply one of the\Nstars in the Southern Cross to each of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I thought it might use that to\Nforce us to maintain a certain distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Kirara can approach the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you and I can approach each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So maybe Kirara and the door's\Nstars are repelling ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like opposite magnets\Npush each other away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that doesn't sound right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.06,0:09:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that were true, Kyura would\Njust flee into the monitor room.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if they hugged the inside\Nof the door, we'd be stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:56.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.28,0:10:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Star A is able to approach\NStar B, but B can't approach A.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each star has only one other\Nstar they're compatible with,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they cannot approach any other star but\Nthat one, like in rock, paper, scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:13.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you and I can approach each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.22,0:10:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have no problem moving\Ntoward one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's a no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.40,0:10:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's more like a stamp rally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.72,0:10:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where you have to follow a set route\Nand approach each one in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And things with the same\Nstar get drawn together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.24,0:10:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.54,0:10:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if the Sorcerer isn't counted\Nas one of the stars in the Constellation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.38,0:10:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.82,0:10:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they were forced to\Nstay away from Demon Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just look at Kyurena.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're obviously on high\Nalert about our next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because they're afraid that\Nwhile they're not looking,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.58,0:10:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we manage to get what we need in\Norder to enter that monitor room.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.10,0:10:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So forget four stars, there's\Nat least five or more. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my stamp rally theory is correct,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:11:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then with only four stars, we should\Nbe able to approach Kirara freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't, so there\Nhas to be a fifth star.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the star we have to pass\Nthrough to reach Kirara and that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if there are six or seven stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.68,0:11:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I'm really hoping\Nthat's not what we're up against.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.04,0:11:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's confusing enough with five\Nstars if they figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.36,0:11:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go and find that star
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.84,0:11:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go throwing cars right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same Imai star on me is on that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you throw it, it'll just come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.06,0:11:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or pull you toward it\Nlike Demon Dog did to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:11:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They probably have to touch the\Ntarget to plant a star on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, they can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.68,0:12:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirara hasn't touched me or Rabbit Escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.04,0:12:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They only touched Demon Dog, Meaning\NKirara isn't tagging objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're tagging cursed energy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order to tag doors and cars,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it might need someone to imbue cursed\Nenergy into them ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The car has residual cursed\Nenergy from someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the technique doesn't\Ncover a wide range,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.88,0:12:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then traces of the other star should be…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.35,0:12:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fifth star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.74,0:12:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see any more residual cursed\Nenergy from anyone other than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiraras already marked\Ntheir own cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they can't use it to\Nmark objects with the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,same acroxed star that\Nthey labeled me with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:13:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meaning they can't launch things\Nat me like they did with that car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.68,0:13:04.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once I touch that, I can approach Kirara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.08,0:13:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro's hypothesis was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:10.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kireira's cursed technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:15.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love Rendezvous, assigns one of five stars\Nto the cursed energy of their targets,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.20,0:13:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,using the Southern Cross as a base.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For one star to approach another, it\Nmust follow a predetermined order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.46,0:13:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things marked with the same star\Nare attracted to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.82,0:13:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you actually\Nfigured out my technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Panda! Here, catch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That order was nearest\Nto the farthest star.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.04,0:13:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Constellations may look flat, but\Nthey do, of course, have depth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.48,0:14:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And each star has a different\Ndistance from Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.72,0:14:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:05.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you thought, there's no way I\Ncould throw objects at you any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.92,0:14:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I can just lick the Ginon\Nstar placed on my own cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and mark things with the same\NAcrux star that I put on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.67,0:14:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.72,0:14:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy, he never dismissed\Nhis doggy Shikigami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he figure out which of the same tagged\Nobjects would be drawn to the other?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he put a wall between\Nhimself and the Shikigami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Shikigami would\Nbe drawn into the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.92,0:14:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he unleashed the doggie when\NI was in a line between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.64,0:14:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cancel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please go out like the new mix?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.18,0:15:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Kuroi, just hear us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Set me up with my own technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you could\Nhave known if you or
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dog you would get\Npulled toward the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.18,0:15:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took a gamble, but\Nnow I know for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one with the greater cursed\Nenergy pulls the other towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.52,0:15:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first time I was\Npulled into Demon Dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but when I strengthened my cursed energy\Nto guard against your incoming attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.18,0:15:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the opposite happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really just a first-year?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weren't cute at all, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:15:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please hear us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.82,0:16:02.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujikura... Panda...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.36,0:16:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Underestimating me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it with this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even trying to dodge my punches
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.88,0:16:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You crazy or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't like the fight, Shibuya
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.76,0:16:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is me looking\NHakari in the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.62,0:16:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until he accepts me,\NI won't dodge anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't fight back, not until he caves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.80,0:17:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll listen to what you have to say\Nfor as long as you remain standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, baby, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.90,0:17:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These kids just want your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hear them out, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.96,0:17:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just said I would, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Itadori, why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time we've met, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.54,0:17:27.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why did you come to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my friends told me you were strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.70,0:17:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When one sorcerer asks another for help,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's an understood agreement that\Nthey're asking him to risk his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.74,0:17:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I'm gonna throw\Nmy chips in with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.66,0:17:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you better show me that you have a\Npassion worth risking my life for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.94,0:17:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet you offer me nothing, saying you're\Njust here following orders. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.04,0:18:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man Yaga should be\Nweeding out losers like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have any passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing but a cog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cog in a sorcerer's machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that keeps exercising curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.34,0:18:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cog.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.98,0:18:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cause that's damn boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.58,0:18:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:42.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It hurts, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.88,0:18:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what Gojo once told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That my cursed energy was coarser and\Ngrittier than anyone else he's ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.72,0:18:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you dead yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Panda! Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You and Sea Urchin Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take Edori's body and get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.10,0:19:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't ever come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took three unguarded blows!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.28,0:19:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus I hit him with a whole\Nlot of punches before, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.26,0:19:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you made of, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.38,0:19:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing but a cog.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But cogs have a function, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.58,0:19:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My function is to keep exercising curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because I need you to achieve that,\Nthen I'll play along until you agree to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.92,0:19:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kinji Hakari, what's your function?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.34,0:19:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is what a cog's\Npassion looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.36,0:19:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep punching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.86,0:19:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kin, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you're all heated up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.50,0:20:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fever never lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.70,0:20:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down here, you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.76,0:20:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's cut a deal. But you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.60,0:20:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's resolved did you just
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.80,0:20:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,convince him to Do that mm-hmm\Nthank you for saving his life
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.46,0:20:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All good we may hate the upper\Nbrass at Jujutsu High but it's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:35.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,undeniable kin's Fever burns\Nhottest when he's helping others
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be advised.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:51.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,effective immediately a player has\Nadded a new rule to the culling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.02,0:20:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rule number nine, players will\Nknow each other's information,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first names, last names,\Nnumber of points accumulated,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,current colony and number of\Nrules added to the game by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have gained five points for a kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.62,0:21:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're damn right I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single one of these\Nguys was strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It really was so much\Nbetter 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Sukuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.48,0:21:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have exceeded 200 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you like to consume 100 points\Nby adding a rule to the calling game?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I knew their names and their\Npoints telling me their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but points go down when adding a rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'd need the number\Nof rules they added to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And knowing which colony\Nthey're in would be valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.20,0:22:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogane, add a rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.16,0:22:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reveal that information for every player.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.68,0:22:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.18,0:23:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in the space\Nbetween dreams and reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.42,0:23:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.33,0:23:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not like Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.68,0:23:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you step inside,\Nyou too become a player.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.42,0:23:54.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And make them add a rule to let\NTsumiki escape the calling game.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.56,0:23:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You

